    q: 'Does an awning need a wind sensor?',
    a: 'For an electric awning we strongly recommend one. The terral (hot land wind) and the levante (east wind) can blow hard and unexpectedly in the Axarquía. A wind sensor retracts the awning automatically, even when you are not home. An awning left open in a gust can be wrecked within minutes.',
  },
